@startuml Iterator

title Iterator Pattern — Fair Upload Session Queue

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

' ── Iterator ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
interface IUploadSessionIterator <<interface>> {
  + MoveNextAsync() : Task<bool>
  + Current : UploadSessionMemento
}

class FairUploadSessionIterator {
  - _caretaker : IUploadSessionCaretaker
  - _buffer : List<UploadSessionMemento>
  - _currentIndex : int
  + MoveNextAsync() : Task<bool>
  + Current : UploadSessionMemento
  - RefreshBufferAsync() : Task
}

' ── Aggregate ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
interface IUploadSessionQueue <<interface>> {
  + GetFairIterator() : IUploadSessionIterator
  + EnqueueAsync(message : Message, telegramId : long) : Task
  + NotifyChange() : void
  + WaitForWorkAsync(ct : CancellationToken) : Task
}

class UploadSessionQueue {
  - _caretaker : IUploadSessionCaretaker
  - _signal : SemaphoreSlim
  + GetFairIterator() : IUploadSessionIterator
  + EnqueueAsync(...) : Task
  + NotifyChange() : void
  + WaitForWorkAsync(...) : Task
}

' ── Consumer ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
class UploadProcessorService <<BackgroundService>> {
  - _queue : IUploadSessionQueue
  - _uploadCommand : SingleAudioUploadCommand
  - _concurrencySemaphore : SemaphoreSlim
  # ExecuteAsync(stoppingToken : CancellationToken) : Task
}

' ── Client ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
class UpdateHandler {
  - _uploadQueue : IUploadSessionQueue
  + HandleUpdateAsync(...) : Task
}

' Realizations
FairUploadSessionIterator ..|> IUploadSessionIterator : realizes
UploadSessionQueue ..|> IUploadSessionQueue : realizes

' Aggregate produces Iterator
UploadSessionQueue ..> IUploadSessionIterator : «creates»
UploadSessionQueue ..> FairUploadSessionIterator : «creates»

' Consumer uses Iterator to traverse Aggregate
UploadProcessorService --> IUploadSessionQueue : uses aggregate
UploadProcessorService ..> IUploadSessionIterator : uses iterator

' Client adds to Aggregate
UpdateHandler --> IUploadSessionQueue : enqueues

note right of FairUploadSessionIterator
  **Concrete Iterator**
  Implements Round-Robin 
  logic by grouping 
  pending sessions by 
  User ID to ensure 
  fairness.
end note

note bottom of UploadSessionQueue
  **Concrete Aggregate**
  Maintains the collection 
  of mementos via the 
  Caretaker and provides 
  the Iterator.
end note

note left of UploadProcessorService
  **Consumer**
  Traverses the queue 
  using the iterator 
  and limits concurrency 
  (max 3 parallel) 
  using a Semaphore.
end note

footer Iterator · GoF Behavioral · NurFlac

@enduml
